==Description==
'''Shrimp Fried Rice''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]]. It is obtained from Level 19 of the premium track, which had a cost of {{BeachBalls|590}} or {{Robux|54}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{BeachBalls|5,460}} or {{Robux|1,172}}. This item also has had two other costs. First one was the cost before its 20% discount, which had a cost of {{Robux|68}} with a total cost of {{Robux|1,475}}. The second was the price prior to the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] individual skip cost fix, where it had a total cost of {{Robux|1,250}}.

==Appearance==
'''Shrimp Fried Rice''' showcases the Level 4 {{Color|Surf|Shrimp}} [[Sniper]] making a shrimp fried rice. It plays a sound of food being fried.

==Trivia==
*This sticker is based on the "[https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/youre-telling-me-a-shrimp-fried-this-rice You're telling me a shrimp fried this rice?]" meme.
*'''Shrimp Fried Rice''' was given out as a physical sticker by the developers during the Roblox Developer Conference 2025.

